== FILE REGIONS (byte offsets in the program file: what made each stretch) ==

      0 - 64      header   ELF header: says this is a 64-bit Linux program and where to start
     64 - 120     header   segment header 1: load the file at 0x400000 (read + run)
    120 - 176     header   segment header 2: an empty space at 0x10000000 (read + write)
    176 - 242     start    startup: note the environment, set up the heap
    242 - 364     line     line 2
    364 - 388     line     line 3
    388 - 443     line     line 4
