  3,715 - 4,001   routine  toolbox routine wait_key: -> rax = the one key pressed (no Enter needed when it's a real terminal).
  4,001 - 4,060   routine  toolbox routine sleep: rax = nanoseconds to wait.
  4,060 - 4,144   routine  toolbox routine random: rax = lowest, rcx = highest -> rax = a random whole number from lowest to highest.
  4,144 - 4,198   routine  toolbox routine now: rdi = which clock (0 time of day, 1 stopwatch) -> rax = nanoseconds.
  4,198 - 4,250   routine  toolbox routine elapsed: rax = a stopwatch start -> rax = seconds since then, as a decimal.
  4,250 - 4,489   routine  toolbox routine time_text: -> rax = the time of day as HH:MM:SS (UTC).
